OL,3,AFort Hood attacker's execution by
OL,4,Afiring squad will be livestreamed,
OL,5,APentagon says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe public will be able to watch the
OL,8,Fexecution of a former US Army major by
OL,9,Ffiring squad, US Defence Secretary Pete
OL,10,FHegseth has said.
OL,12,FA Defense Department official told the
OL,13,FBBC the execution of Nidal Hasan, who
OL,14,Fshot dead 13 unarmed US soldiers at
OL,15,FFort Hood in 2009, would be
OL,16,Flivestreamed.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
