OL,3,ARussian strike on buses kills at least
OL,4,A30, say officials, as deadly attacks on
OL,5,AUkraine surge
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 30 people have been killed in
OL,8,Fa Russian glide bomb attack on two
OL,9,Fcivilian buses in the eastern front
OL,10,Fline city of Kramatorsk, rescue
OL,11,Fofficials say.
OL,13,FAuthorities said three people were also
OL,14,Fkilled in the village of Bilenke, part
OL,15,Fof the Kramatorsk community.
OL,17,FAnother 18 people were wounded, said
OL,18,FDonetsk regional head Vadym Filashkin,
OL,19,Faccusing Russia of targeting buses
OL,20,Fcarrying passengers to kill as many
OL,21,Fcivilians as possible.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
